## 👋 About Me

I'm a multidisciplinary graphic designer with 7+ years of experience crafting brand identities, digital content, and user interfaces that actually connect with people. My work lives at the intersection of strategic thinking and visual craft — from building cohesive brand systems from the ground up, to designing social media content that drives real engagement.

What sets me apart is how I work: I've embraced AI-assisted design tools not as shortcuts, but as genuine creative accelerators. Whether I'm using generative AI for rapid visual ideation or automating repetitive production steps, I'm always focused on what matters most — delivering brand-aligned, high-impact results with consistency and speed.

Beyond client work, I'm an active stock media contributor on Freepik and Adobe Stock, with thousands of published assets and tens of thousands of downloads worldwide. It's my way of staying sharp, staying creative, and sharing work with a global audience every single day.

